#: ../../whatsnew/3.14.rst:1056
msgid ""
"The default value of the :ref:`program name <prog>` "
"for :class:`argparse.ArgumentParser` now reflects the way the Python "
"interpreter was instructed to find the ``__main__`` module code. "
