msgid "(Contributed by Kumar Aditya in :gh:`126353`.)"
msgstr "(Beigetragen von Kumar Aditya in :gh:`126353`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.14.rst:2417
msgid ""
"There's a few patterns that use :func:`asyncio.get_event_loop`, most of them "
"can be replaced with :func:`asyncio.run`."
msgstr ""
"Es gibt einige Muster, die :func:`asyncio.get_event_loop` verwenden. Die "
"meisten lassen sich durch :func:`asyncio.run` ersetzen."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.14.rst:2420
msgid "If you're running an async function, simply use :func:`asyncio.run`."
msgstr ""
"Wenn du eine asynchrone Funktion ausführst, verwende "
"einfach :func:`asyncio.run`."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.14.rst:2422 ../../whatsnew/3.14.rst:2449
#: ../../whatsnew/3.14.rst:2477
msgid "Before:"
msgstr "Vorher:"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.14.rst:2424
msgid ""
"async def main():\n"
"    ...\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"loop = asyncio.get_event_loop()\n"
"try:\n"
"    loop.run_until_complete(main())\n"
"finally:\n"
"    loop.close()"
msgstr ""
"async def main():\n"
"    ...\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"loop = asyncio.get_event_loop()\n"
"try:\n"
"    loop.run_until_complete(main())\n"
"finally:\n"
"    loop.close()"

